  "decisions": [
    "Keep original 16-color registration order in equipment, immediately before magic research papers.",
    "Persist block registry name and native named state properties; do not store temporary registry indices or packed 12-bit block/4-bit metadata.",
    "Original scanner mapping uses ST.meta_(tScanned) rather than metadata from its mapping entry; legacy ordinary crop inputs therefore retain initial states. Modern native BlockItem state data is additionally retained.",
    "Modern bed/door variants are actual BlockItems, so their stable block identity is directly scanned.",
    "Original IC2 Obscurator integration is external compatibility work; no standalone clone or fictitious modern retexture event introduced.",
    "Canvas scope does not replace existing blueprint/material providers or implement remaining book/map/schematic scanning."
  ]
